			(property "Description" "Keystone 3586 SMT universal-entry female quick-fit blade clip (top & side entry), auto-blade-fuse-clip lineage. Accepts .110-.250in (2.8-6.4mm) wide male tabs, .020-.032in (0.51-0.81mm) thick (family spec, Keystone PC Quick-Fit Terminals catalog p.53, CAT NO. 3557 table; keyelco product page confirms the same .110-.250in width range for 3586 itself). 0.016in (0.40mm) thick brass, tin-nickel plate. 3 SMD solder pads (2 main legs + 1 support/anchor foot) — all one electrical node (single receptacle contact). Footprint pad geometry verified against Keystone dwg no. 3586 rev D (pad width .105in/2.66mm exact match; pad-row envelope .260in/6.60mm minus pad height = 4.90mm center spacing, matching the vendored land)."
				(at 0 0 0)
